/*
  TriggerConfigurator.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0086 · TriggerConfigurator (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  `TriggerConfigurator` resolves (table "TriggerConfigurator") lives here with its web
  `t(key, default)` English value. These entries fold into the app
  `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a
  per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without
  editing the shared catalog.

  The first groups are the exact keys extracted from the web source
  (features/automations/pages/TriggerConfigurator.tsx). The remainder back the
  native-only geofence-query chrome (loading / error / empty / stale / offline) and the
  VoiceOver labels.
*/

